  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex REXIS Feel is a premium nylon multifilament designed around superior ball pocketing, feel and control. It uses Yonex's FRF (Fusion of Resin Filament) process and molecular-level Plasma Bonding, with FORTIMO™ polyurethane developed by Mitsui Chemicals filling the gaps between nylon filaments to improve elasticity, repulsion and durability. Within the REXIS family, Feel sits on the softer, deeper-pocketing side of the official performance map and is intended for players of all swing speeds who prioritize connected feel and controlled pocketing.",

    "zh": "Yonex REXIS Feel 是一款以 Ball Pocketing、Feel 与 Control 为核心的高端尼龙多芯球线。它采用 Yonex 的 FRF（Fusion of Resin Filament）工艺和分子级 Plasma Bonding 技术，并使用由 Mitsui Chemicals 开发的 FORTIMO™ 聚氨酯材料填充传统 Multifilament 纤维之间的空隙，从而提升弹性、回弹力和耐久性。根据 Yonex 官方 Comfort & Playability 图，REXIS Feel 位于偏 Soft、Ball Pocketing 很深的区域，因此相比 REXIS Speed 更强调包球与手感，相比 REXIS Comfort 则更加偏向清晰反馈与方向控制。"
  },

